r-driver/10848699/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-8204cc9d7a569f36da5063a86b52364dc48ddddb18dc1c9f4870e75dbdf2e657","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"罗斯伯格谈梅赛德斯荷兰站车队指令：支持让安东内利让车","summaryZh":"前梅赛德斯F1车手尼科·罗斯伯格为车队在荷兰大奖赛期间的车队指令进行了辩护。比赛在赞德沃特赛道因马克斯·维斯塔潘的严重撞车而中断，红旗后重新开始。在后期虚拟安全车期间，基米·安东内利进站换上了软胎，而乔治·拉塞尔则留在赛道上。罗斯伯格认为，梅赛德斯要求安东内利让拉塞尔通过是合理的，因为拉塞尔的经验和位置更有利于车队利益。","publishedAt":"2026-08-24T17:11:52.106Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-23T16:25:40.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-8.motorsport.com/images/amp/0JXRB3OY/s6/andrea-kimi-antonelli-mercedes-2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":236865,"altZh":"罗斯伯格谈梅赛德斯荷兰站车队指令：支持让安东内利让车"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/nico-rosberg-weighs-in-on-mercedes-dutch-gp-team-orders-between-kimi-antonelli-and-george-russell/10848674/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-338432274fe7fcc7f6f0b58fbaca710a6b203bcea666f74b38fa36b0cbe92ce2","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"拉塞尔承认梅赛德斯荷兰站车队指令“正确决定”","summaryZh":"梅赛德斯车手乔治·拉塞尔承认，在荷兰大奖赛尾声，车队决定让他与队友基米·安东内利互换位置是“正确的决定”，当时他们正在为仅次于冠军兰多·诺里斯的第二名而战。安东内利和拉塞尔分别位居第二和第四，中间隔着法拉利的刘易斯·汉密尔顿，此时因埃斯特班·奥康的赛车故障触发了晚期的虚拟安全车。","publishedAt":"2026-08-24T17:11:52.106Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-23T15:56:19.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-9.motorsport.com/images/amp/6x7LEwjY/s6/andrea-kimi-antonelli-mercedes.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","dec